                "feedbacks-1776878048349": {
                    "type": "feedbacks",
                    "properties": {
                        "title": "Don't take our word for it.",
                        "subtitle": "Our customers speak for themselves. Here's what they had to say.",
                        "amount": "10",
                        "hide_automatic_feedbacks": true
                    }
                },
                "faq-1776422690117": {
                    "type": "faq",
                    "properties": {
                        "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
                        "subtitle": "The five we get asked most, before anyone hands over money. Anything not covered here, ask in the Discord and you'll get a straight answer.",
                        "items": [
                            {
                                "question": "What payment methods do you accept?",
                                "answer": "Card (Visa and Mastercard), Apple Pay, Google Pay, and crypto: Bitcoin, Ethereum or Litecoin. It is all handled at checkout, and we never see or store your card details. Crypto is no slower than card. The order completes on confirmation and the key appears the same way."
                            },
                            {
                                "question": "How do I contact support?",
                                "answer": "Discord is fastest and it is where most things get sorted: discord.gg\/zazacheats. You can also open a ticket from the customer portal, or email support@zazacheats.net. Replies usually land inside ten minutes while we are awake. We answer questions from people who have not bought anything yet, so ask before you buy rather than after."
                            },
                            {
                                "question": "Are your products safe to use?",
                                "answer": "Nobody honest will promise you a cheat that can never be detected, so we do not. What we do instead is publish the build's current state on the status page, linked at the top of every page, marked Undetected, Updating or Detected, alongside a dated log of every change we have ever made to it. Read it before you buy. If the build goes down for 24 hours or more, that time is added back onto your key."
                            },
                            {
                                "question": "Do you offer any discounts?",
                                "answer": "The longer keys are the discount. A month key works out far cheaper per day than buying a day key thirty times over, and the lifetime key stops the maths entirely. Past that we run the occasional sale, announced in the Discord and nowhere else. There is no permanent coupon to hunt for, so do not waste your time looking for one."
                            },
                            {
                                "question": "Can I use the product on multiple PCs?",
                                "answer": "One key, one PC. The licence locks to that machine's HWID the first time you run the loader. That is what stops a single key being passed around a friend group, which is how a private build stops being private and ends up detected. If you genuinely change machine, new build or dead motherboard, open a ticket and we will reset the HWID for you."
                            }
                        ],
                        "background": "primary"
                    }
                },
